:"美国","title":"8月CPI同比","event":"CPI同比","country_id":"US","quantity":"","unit":"%","importance":4,"mark":"BB","push_status":true,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg","calendar_key":"4882edd633558d1f131920a0f670b47d","actual":"3.4","forecast":"3.4","previous":"3.4","revised":"","period":"月","calendar_type":"FD","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/US111017/overview","assets":"cmd,fx,bd,stk@cn,stk@hk,stk@us","foresight":"前瞻 | 美联储“传声筒”理事沃勒的政策倾向正由审慎偏鹰转向乐观按兵不动，但强调这并非立场的根本逆转。而8月通胀数据是决定9月会议是否加息的关键变量。\n\nBianco Research创始人Bianco表示，沃勒已表态倾向维持利率不变，美联储9月议息会议的投票格局目前为6票（维持）对5票（加息），理事鲍威尔的立场尚不明朗，或成“一票定音”的关键人物。距会议不足两周，加息概率实际已接近50/50，鲍威尔的沉默成为不确定性来源。"},{"id":1590867,"public_date":1789129800,"observation_date":"2026-08-01","wscn_ticker":"US111045","country":"美国","title":"8月核心CPI环比","event":"核心CPI环比","country_id":"US","quantity":"","unit":"%","importance":2,"mark":"BB","push_status":true,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg","calendar_key":"4a8ea90d402dd5542e60e4b9fba9d83e","actual":"0.3","forecast":"0.2","previous":"0.2","revised":"","period":"月","calendar_type":"FD","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/US111045/overview","assets":"cmd,fx,bd,stk@us","foresight":""},{"id":1590866,"public_date":1789129800,"observation_date":"2026-08-01","wscn_ticker":"US111044","country":"美国","title":"8月CPI环比","event":"CPI环比","country_id":"US","quantity":"","unit":"%","importance":2,"mark":"BB","push_status":true,"flag_uri":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d2ee5d16-9b68-4204-bfd4-b57bd2c16f2c.jpg","calendar_key":"dc74b681980fd1c7431c5971f0b8dc99","actual":"0.4","forecast":"0.4","previous":"0.1","revised":"","period":"月","calendar_type":"FD","subscribe_status":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/calendar/US111044/overview","assets":"cmd,fx,bd,stk@us","foresight":""},{"id":1590874,"public_date":1789135200,"observation_date":"2026-09-01","wscn_ticker":"US111025"